FILE:           T29_moment_power.csv
SHA256:         5d0eb1269fb6dfaf4ddf58cf4e063a76a3a6235c8201d3cd459011b7a9e8b313
PRODUCER:       code/S30_moment_power.R
PRODUCER_SHA256: 11749fab77d893c09596cf0f62c6ed82d1b160c5fcb2e5c6c8c10b1ebc82adc9
INPUTS:
  meta/canonical_facts.md: (runtime read, ledger)
  output/T22_theta_A_treated.csv: (n_post_cells column)
SEED:           20260719
REPS:           400

SPECIFICATION:
  Pooled higher-moment separation power calculation.
  Measures power of pooled excess kurtosis to distinguish World T (transitory
  effect variation) from World V (volatility change) under non-normal shocks.

  Grid: kappa_u in {0, 0.75, 1.0, 1.5, 3.0} x w/E[sigma^2] in {0.10, 0.25, 0.50, 1.00}

  COLUMNS (INV-040 amendment):
    mc_se_mc          = sd(delta_vec)/sqrt(reps)   -- Monte Carlo precision
    sd_single_dataset = sd(delta_vec)              -- Sampling SD in one realization
    z                 = |delta| / sd_single_dataset -- Identification-relevant z

  Old version had z = |delta| / mc_se, which overstated z by sqrt(reps) = 20.

GATES:
  G1: Normal identification (kappa_u=0) -- |delta| < 3*mc_se: PASS
  G2: Variance match (Var_V = Var_T by construction): PASS
  G3: Monotonicity -- z increases in both kappa_u and w: PASS (0 violations)
  G4: Precision -- mc_se < 0.10*|delta| for kappa_u > 0: PASS

LEDGER QUANTITIES:
  MOMPOW_KAPPA0_DELTA:       -0.000485 (mean delta at kappa_u=0)
  MOMPOW_IDENT_MIN_Z:        2.96 (kappa_u=0.75, w/E=0.10)
  MOMPOW_IDENT_KAPPA1_W50_Z: 5.83 (kappa_u=1.0, w/E=0.50)
  MOMPOW_IDENT_MAX_Z:        11.44 (kappa_u=3.0, w/E=1.00)
  MOMPOW_IDENT_DEFF10_MAX_Z: 3.62 (max cell, assumed DEFF=10)
  MOMPOW_IDENT_DEFF50_MAX_Z: 1.62 (max cell, assumed DEFF=50)

A1_VERIFICATION:
  Old z / sqrt(400) = new z, verified cell by cell.
  Old hash: 8bed5f08f287a94aee351fef1862b66190efbae14355f8c66f179a356d0d3cc2

CREATED: 2026-08-03
